# lib/

Root module layer for Riffle's core system. Exports the main Riffle module and delegates domain logic to the specialized subdomains (context, predicates, staging) organized under the `riffle/` namespace.

## Dirs

- `riffle/` -- Sense-infer-act pipeline runtime with context management, predicate evaluation, and staged processing

## Files

- `riffle.ex` -- Root application module; documents the Riffle streaming and predicate evaluation philosophy
